{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חֲבַל","hw":"חֲבַל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲבַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Pa.</strong>  <strong> destroy, hurt (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָבַל²\" href=\"/BDB,_חָבַל²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. חבל</a><strong>)</strong>;—Pf. 3 mpl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַבְּלוּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:23\" href=\"/Daniel.6.23\">Dn 6:23</a> (of lions); Imv. mpl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַבְּלוּהִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">4:20</a> (sf. of tree); Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחַבָּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:12\" href=\"/Ezra.6.12\">Ezr 6:12</a> (acc. of temple).<br><strong>Hithpa.</strong>  <em>be destroyed:</em> Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָא תִּתְחַבַּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:44\" href=\"/Daniel.2.44\">Dn 2:44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:27\" href=\"/Daniel.6.27\">6:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:14\" href=\"/Daniel.7.14\">7:14</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">-בַּ֑ל</span>; all of kingdom of God).","next":"BDB Aramaic, חֲבָל","prev":"BDB Aramaic, זְרַע"}